# `hilavitkutin-providers`

Default implementations of the hilavitkutin-api contracts, for a
consumer to register on the scheduler builder with `.with(...)`, one
store at a time or as a Kit. Each sits behind a feature the consumer
turns on, named for what it rests on; a build on default features
carries only the interner contracts. `static` carries the memory
providers over a buffer the consumer hands in, `StaticBumpMemory` and
`StaticFreeListMemory`, which takes blocks back. `portable` carries
`ArenaColumnStorage`, the interner (`StringInterner` over an inline
`MemoryArena`, and `InternerKit`), the adapt unit `AdaptWu` with its
kits, and the metrics resources with `MetricsKit`. The engine's `os`
feature carries `OsClock` and `OsMemoryProvider`. Depends on the api,
str and kit crates, never on the engine.
